<title>POLAND: Grajewo soars 57.8 pct on bourse debut.</title>
<headline>Grajewo soars 57.8 pct on bourse debut.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish chipboard producer Grajewo SA started trade on the Warsaw bourse's parallel market at 142 zlotys, 57.8 percent above its issue price.</p>
<p>Grajewo's January 550,000-share initial public offering priced at 90 zlotys per share was heavily oversubscribed.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
